## Quick Reference

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| General info | `this.logger.log(message)` |
| Error with stack | `this.logger.error(message, error.stack)` |
| Warning | `this.logger.warn(message)` |
| Debug info | `this.logger.debug(message)` |
| Detailed trace | `this.logger.verbose(message)` |
| Custom metadata | `this.logger.getWinstonLogger().info(message, { meta })` |

## Migration Checklist

When updating existing code:

- [ ] Import `LoggerService` from `'../../common/logger'`
- [ ] Create private readonly logger instance
- [ ] Replace `console.log()` with `this.logger.log()`
- [ ] Replace `console.error()` with `this.logger.error(message, stack)`
- [ ] Replace `console.warn()` with `this.logger.warn()`
- [ ] Add context name (service/controller name)
- [ ] Test logs appear in console and files
- [ ] Remove all `console.*` calls
